          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "turn": 4,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Which one of Liberica and Excelsa is better for me?",
          "user_rubrik": "Which one of Liberica and Excelsa is better for me?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Choosing between Liberica and Excelsa depends on your taste preferences and how your body reacts to coffee. Liberica beans have a smoky, earthy flavor with subtle floral and fruity notes, which might be gentler on your stomach if brewed lightly. Excelsa, on the other hand, offers a tart, fruity profile with a hint of smokiness, adding complexity to blends. Since you occasionally experience mild acid reflux, Excelsa\u2019s tart acidity might not be ideal for you. Liberica, with its lighter body and less pronounced acidity, could be a better fit for your morning coffee ritual. Experimenting with small batches of each could help you decide which suits your palate and digestion best.",
          "citations": {
            "clueweb22-en0035-25-05669:8": 29.7987003326416,
            "clueweb22-en0036-21-16351:4": 28.91710090637207
          },
          "ptkb_provenance": [
