          "text": "For a smooth, gentle-on-the-stomach cup that supports your weight-loss and sugar-free goals, the ideal coffee-to-water ratio is:\n\n**1:15 (1 part coffee to 15 parts water)**\n\n- This ratio works especially well for pour-over methods like Chemex and for cold brew\u2014both of which produce a less acidic, milder coffee that\u2019s easier on digestion and less likely to trigger acid reflux.\n- Use a medium-coarse grind and water just below boiling (195\u2013205\u00b0F) for best extraction and flavor.\n\n**Why this fits your needs:**  \nA 1:15 ratio ensures your coffee is flavorful but not overly strong or bitter, minimizing the need for sugar or additives and keeping it gentle on your stomach.\n\nWould you like step-by-step instructions for your preferred brewing method?",
          "citations": {
