          "user_rubrik": "Which one of Liberica and Excelsa is better for me?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 0,
          "text": "For a sugar-free, weight-loss-friendly, and gentle-on-the-stomach cold brew breakfast, focus on these strategies:\n\n**How to Enjoy Cold Brew for Breakfast**\n\n- **Keep It Black or Add Low-Calorie Options:** Cold brew is naturally smooth and slightly sweet, so you likely won\u2019t need sugar or sweeteners (clueweb22-en0031-00-01085). If you want to adjust the flavor, add a splash of unsweetened almond milk or a dash of cinnamon\u2014both are low in calories and won\u2019t trigger acid reflux (clueweb22-en0017-55-00448, clueweb22-en0015-09-14580).\n- **Natural, Sugar-Free Sweeteners:** If you prefer a touch of sweetness, monk fruit or stevia are ideal\u2014they\u2019re non-glycemic, zero-calorie, and won\u2019t impact weight loss (clueweb22-en0020-86-05263, clueweb22-en0004-00-10714).\n- **Pair with a Light, Filling Breakfast:** To avoid stomach upset,",
