          "user_utterance": "Sounds good! What light breakfast options pair well with cold brew?",
          "user_rubrik": "What is the impact of roasting on coffee taste?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 0,
          "text": "For a light, sugar-free, weight-loss-friendly breakfast that pairs well with cold brew and is gentle on your stomach, focus on these options:\n\n**Top Pairings:**\n\n- **Protein Bars (Low-Sugar/Weight-Loss Focused):**  \n  Convenient, filling, and often recommended with cold brew for a balanced, on-the-go breakfast. Look for bars with high protein, low sugar, and minimal artificial ingredients (clueweb22-en0011-26-13604).\n\n- **Egg-Based Options:**  \n  Scrambled eggs, egg white wraps, or breakfast bowls (without bread) are low in carbs, high in protein, and easy on digestion. Many cafes offer egg and cheese wraps or bowls that fit your needs (clueweb22-en0029-88-01775, clueweb22-en0035-79-08286).\n\n- **Avocado Toast (on Whole Grain or Seed Bread):**  \n  Provides healthy fats and fiber, which help with satiety and are gentle on the stomach. Skip high-sugar toppings (clueweb22",
