          "user_rubrik": "What is the impact of roasting on coffee taste?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 0,
          "text": "Drinking cold brew coffee in the morning offers several health benefits that align with your goals:\n\n**Gentle on the Stomach:**  \n- Cold brew is up to 67% less acidic than hot coffee, making it much easier on sensitive stomachs and less likely to trigger acid reflux (clueweb22-en0010-68-10487, clueweb22-en0021-32-05411).\n\n**Supports Weight Loss:**  \n- Black cold brew is naturally sugar-free and very low in calories, especially when enjoyed without milk or sweeteners (clueweb22-en0029-14-17179, clueweb22-en0029-88-01775).\n- Caffeine can help suppress appetite and boost metabolism, aiding weight management (clueweb22-en0022-39-08922).\n\n**Antioxidant and Cognitive Benefits:**  \n- Cold brew retains antioxidants that support heart, brain, and metabolic health (clueweb22-en0015-85-04874).\n- Morning coffee can enhance alertness and cognitive performance.\n\n**Encourages Healthier Hab",
