          "user_utterance": "Interesting\u2014what about the kinds of coffee beans? Can you list some?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are the different types of coffee beans?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "There are several types of coffee beans, but the two main types are Arabica and Robusta. Arabica beans are known for their smoother flavor and are considered to be of higher quality. Robusta beans, on the other hand, have a harsher flavor and more caffeine. There are also other types, such as Liberica and Excelsa, but they are less common. Additionally, some coffee blends combine beans from different regions to create a unique flavor profile. You can also consider the roast type, strength, and freshness of the beans to find the best one for your taste preferences.",
          "citations": {
