          "text": "Considering your acid reflux issue, Liberica might be a better choice for you as it has a lower acidity compared to Excelsa, which has a tart acidity. Additionally, since you don't eat sugar, Liberica's heavier flavor profile might be more suitable for you, as it can hold its own without added sweetness. However, it's always a good idea to try both and see which one works best for your taste preferences and health needs.",
