          "text": "Liberica beans are relatively rare and make up less than 2% of global coffee production. They are mostly grown in Southeast Asia, particularly in Malaysia. You might not find them easily in local stores in Canada, but you can try looking for specialty coffee shops or online retailers that import unique and exotic coffee beans. They might carry Liberica beans or be able to order them for you. Be prepared for a potentially higher price point due to their rarity and limited production.",
