      {
        "turn": 9,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That\u2019s clear\u2014thanks! If I want to pair Liberica coffee with something for breakfast, what would go well, considering I don\u2019t eat sugar?",
          "user_rubrik": "Which one of Liberica and Excelsa is better for me?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "Considering you don't eat sugar, a good pairing for Liberica coffee would be something savory. Bacon is a popular choice that goes well with coffee, as the salty, fatty, and savory flavor complements the smoky or woody notes in Liberica beans. You could also try pairing it with scrambled eggs or other breakfast foods that aren't sweet. If you prefer something a bit more indulgent, dark chocolate is an option, given your exception to the no-sugar rule. Look for sugar-free or low-sugar options to pair with your Liberica coffee.",
