          "user_utterance": "Thanks, that\u2019s helpful! What are the different types of coffee beans out there?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are the different types of coffee beans?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "There are two main types of coffee beans: Arabica and Robusta. Arabica beans are generally considered to be of higher quality and have a milder, more flavorful taste. They are also lower in acidity, which may be beneficial for your stomach. Robusta beans, on the other hand, have a harsher, more bitter taste and are often used in instant coffees. Within these two main categories, there are many variations and blends, but Arabica is a good starting point for those looking for a smoother, more gentle coffee.",
