          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "That\u2019s not quite what I was looking for\u2014I\u2019m after advice on making good coffee, not programming tips! Could you give me some basic steps or important factors in brewing a great cup of coffee?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to make a good coffee?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 2,
          "text": "You might be interested in a single-serve coffee maker or a pour-over drip coffee maker. These types of coffee makers allow you to make one cup of coffee at a time and offer a high degree of control over the brewing process. Some popular options include hand drip coffee",
          "citations": {
