          },
          "ptkb_provenance": []
        }
      },
      {
        "turn": 4,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "There are several types of coffee beans, but the main ones are Arabica, Robusta, and Liberica. Arabica is the most common and considered to be of higher quality, with a smoother and more nuanced flavor. Robusta is bolder and has a harsher taste, while Liberica is less common and has a distinctive flavor. Arabica is also generally easier on the stomach, which is why I recommended it earlier. You can experiment with different types and blends to find the one that suits your taste preferences.",
          "user_rubrik": "What are the different types of coffee beans?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "There are several types of coffee beans, but the main ones are Arabica, Robusta, and Liberica. Arabica is the most common and considered to be of higher quality, with a smoother and more nuanced flavor. Robusta is bolder and has a harsher taste, while Liberica is less common and has a distinctive flavor. Arabica is also generally easier on the stomach, which is why I recommended it earlier. You can experiment with different types and blends to find the one that suits your taste preferences.",
