          "ptkb_provenance": []
        }
      },
      {
        "turn": 6,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Interesting! Which one of Liberica and Excelsa is better for me? I care about something gentle on my stomach and need to avoid too much caffeine.",
          "user_rubrik": "Which one of Liberica and Excelsa is better for me?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Based on your requirements, Excelsa beans might be a better option for you. They generally have lower caffeine levels compared to Liberica, which could be easier on your stomach. Additionally, Excelsa beans have a smoother flavor profile, which might be more gentle on your stomach. However, it's essential to note that individual tolerance to coffee and caffeine can vary greatly, so it's always a good idea to try a small amount first and see how your body reacts. You may also consider trying a medium to dark roast, as they tend to be smoother on the stomach.",
          "citations": {
