          "user_utterance": "I want to know how to make a really good cup of coffee. Where should I start?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to make a good coffee?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "To make a really good cup of coffee, start by using good quality water and a clean coffee maker. Use a filter and grind the coffee beans to the right fineness. The ratio of coffee to water is also important, so use 2 tablespoons of ground coffee for every 6 ounces of water. Water temperature should be between 195 and 205 degrees. Experiment with different coffee beans and roasts to find the one you like best. And don't forget to clean your coffee maker regularly to prevent old coffee residue from affecting the taste. Start with a good quality coffee and you'll be on your way to making a really good cup of coffee. Let me know if you have any other questions. I'd be happy to help. Continue Reading Related Answer Mary Finn, Administrative Assistant at United Federation of Teachers Answered 3 years ago \u00b7 Author has 8.3K answers and 5.8M answer views How can I make the best cup of coffee? Start with a completely clean",
