          "ptkb_provenance": [
            "1. Ability: User owns a few different coffee grinders.",
            "2. - The user prefers coffee to be smooth.",
            "3. - The user is interested in learning how to make high-quality coffee.",
            "4. I occasionally experience mild acid reflux and prefer beverages that are gentle on the stomach."
