          "ptkb_provenance": [
            "1. I occasionally experience mild acid reflux and prefer beverages that are gentle on the stomach.",
            "2. The user prefers coffee to be smooth.",
            "3. I like to try something new here and then.",
            "4. Ability: User owns a few different coffee grinders."
