          "user_utterance": "Which one of Liberica and Excelsa is better for me?",
          "user_rubrik": "Which one of Liberica and Excelsa is better for me?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "Considering your preference for stomach-friendly coffee due to mild acid reflux, Excelsa beans would likely be less suitable as they are described as having a \"tart acidity.\" Liberica beans, on the other hand, offer a full or heavy body and unique floral, fruity, smoky, or earthy notes, without mention of tartness, making them a potentially better option for a strong and stomach-friendly cup.",
