          "user_utterance": "I\u2019m looking to make a really good cup of coffee! What are your top tips?",
          "user_rubrik": "How to make a good coffee?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 3,
          "text": "To make a good, stomach-friendly coffee, opt for **darker roasts** or **cold brew**, which are naturally less acidic. If caffeine is a trigger, **decaf coffee** is a good alternative. You can further reduce acidity by adding a **pinch of baking soda** or **almond milk** to your cup. Additionally, consider brewing with or adding **ginger** or **cinnamon** for their stomach-calming properties.",
