        "turn": 5,
        "response": {
          "rank": 1,
          "user_utterance": "Great, that helps! Can you quickly list the different main types of coffee beans?",
          "user_rubrik": "What are the different types of coffee beans?",
          "user_rubrik_score": 5,
          "text": "The four main types of coffee beans are Arabica, Robusta, Liberica, and Excelsa. Arabica and Robusta are the most common globally, with Arabica known for its sweeter, more delicate taste and Robusta for its stronger, more bitter profile. Liberica and Excelsa are less common but offer unique flavors.",
