          "text": "Yes, grinding coffee beans right before brewing is highly recommended as it preserves the natural flavors, oils, and aromas that quickly diminish after grinding. For the best results, invest in a burr grinder. Burr grinders provide a more consistent and even grind compared to blade grinders, which is crucial for optimal flavor extraction and a superior cup of coffee.",
